---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title='Terms of Service'
  description='Terms of Service for the Phehlwana Group Investments website - website use, quote requests, and service engagements.'
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class='bg-accent/40 border-b border-border pt-36 pb-14 lg:pt-44 lg:pb-20'>
    <div class='container mx-auto px-4'>
      <p class='text-sm font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-widest mb-2'>
        Legal & Compliance
      </p>
      <h1 class='text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3'>
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class='text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl'>
        The terms governing your use of this website and any quote requests or enquiries submitted through it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class='container mx-auto px-4 py-16'>
    <div class='prose dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl mx-auto'>
      <p class='lead text-muted-foreground text-lg mb-8'>
        Last updated: July 27, 2026. By accessing or using this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.
      </p>

      <hr class='my-8 border-border' />

      <h2>1. About This Website</h2>
      <p>
        This website (phehlwanagroup.co.za) is operated by Phehlwana Group Investments (Pty) Ltd ("we", "us", or "our"), a company offering construction, civil and mechanical engineering, plant hire, cleaning, and security services, registered in South Africa with its office at Office No 06, PKN Office Park, Montana Park, Pretoria.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Use of This Website</h2>
      <p>
        This website is provided for general information about our company and services. You may browse the site, read our content, and submit enquiries in good faith. You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the website for any unlawful purpose or in a way that could damage, disable, or impair it.</li>
        <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the website, server, or database.</li>
        <li>Submit false, misleading, or fraudulent information through our contact or quote request forms.</li>
        <li>Scrape, copy, or reproduce website content for commercial redistribution without our written permission.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Quote Requests and Enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Submitting a quote request or enquiry through this website does not create a binding contract between you and Phehlwana Group Investments. Quotes, pricing, and project timelines discussed via the website or in follow-up correspondence are estimates only and are subject to a separate, formal agreement (such as a signed quotation, proposal, or contract) before any work commences.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on this website - including text, images, logos, graphics, and design - is owned by or licensed to Phehlwana Group Investments and is protected by South African copyright and trademark law. You may view and print pages for personal, non-commercial reference, but may not otherwise reproduce, distribute, or modify any content without our prior written consent.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date, including project examples, service descriptions, and company details. However, we do not warrant that all content is complete, current, or error-free, and we reserve the right to correct or update any information at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by South African law, Phehlwana Group Investments will not be liable for any direct, indirect, or consequential loss or damage arising from your use of this website, including but not limited to loss of data, business interruption, or reliance on information published here. This does not limit any liability that cannot be excluded under South African consumer protection law.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        This website may contain links to third-party sites (such as Google Maps or WhatsApp) for your convenience. We do not control and are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of any third-party sites you access via these links.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms of Service are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes arising from your use of this website will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the South African courts.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Service from time to time to reflect changes to our website or services. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page will reflect the most recent revision. Continued use of the website after changes are published constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:
      </p>
      <p class='bg-muted p-4 rounded-lg border border-border font-medium not-prose text-sm text-foreground flex flex-col gap-2'>
        <span><strong>Company:</strong> Phehlwana Group Investments (Pty) Ltd</span>
        <span><strong>Address:</strong> Office No 06, PKN Office Park, Montana Park, Pretoria, 0182</span>
        <span><strong>Phone:</strong> 012 655 0284</span>
        <span><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:info@phehlwanagroup.co.za' class='text-interactive hover:underline'>info@phehlwanagroup.co.za</a></span>
      </p>

      <p class='text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-8'>
        See also our <a href='/privacy-policy' class='text-interactive hover:underline'>Privacy Policy &amp; POPIA Statement</a> for how we handle your personal information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
